      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.72,
      "end_seconds": 10.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Right, no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.63,
      "end_seconds": 15.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Mainly I've been feeling well. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.13,
      "end_seconds": 20.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.28,
      "end_seconds": 28.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.77,
      "end_seconds": 34.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Right, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.19,
      "end_seconds": 38.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "For about three months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.42,
      "end_seconds": 43.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.93,
      "end_seconds": 45.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.74,
      "end_seconds": 50.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Okay, have you had slightly dry skin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.2,
      "end_seconds": 54.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Yeah. Six months, you know, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.67,
      "end_seconds": 60.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Did you get feeling cold, weight change or constipation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.65,
      "end_seconds": 63.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.19,
      "end_seconds": 67.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.81,
      "end_seconds": 73.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.65,
      "end_seconds": 77.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.97,
      "end_seconds": 81.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Let me think, I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.13,
      "end_seconds": 98.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Right, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.98,
      "end_seconds": 104.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "So, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.99,
      "end_seconds": 110.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.4,
      "end_seconds": 126.75,
      "duration_seconds": 15.35,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I live with my elderly mother. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.83,
      "end_seconds": 142.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.92,
      "end_seconds": 147.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.12,
      "end_seconds": 154.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.19,
      "end_seconds": 156.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.34,
      "end_seconds": 176.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.28,
      "end_seconds": 185.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.62,
      "end_seconds": 216.98,
      "duration_seconds": 11.36,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 69, height 159 centimetres, BMI works out to 37.6, SpO2 98 percent on room air, BP is 112 over 79, weight 95 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.07,
      "end_seconds": 223.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.03,
      "end_seconds": 240.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.22,
      "end_seconds": 244.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.11,
      "end_seconds": 265.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Your pulse is steady and your thyroid feels normal in size."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.23,
      "end_seconds": 278.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Taking everything into account, it fits best with well-controlled thyroid replacement."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.53,
      "end_seconds": 284.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Um, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.77,
      "end_seconds": 307.52,
      "duration_seconds": 21.75,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like well-controlled thyroid replacement, but I'd like to confirm. A thyroid blood test is what I'd like next, for annual review. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'd like you back in twelve months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.41,
      "end_seconds": 310.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.56,
      "end_seconds": 314.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.36,
      "end_seconds": 320.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Oh, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.53,
      "end_seconds": 324.2,
